# Phase 16 (docs/phase-16-plan.md Fork F): normalise every text file to LF in the
# repository and on checkout, regardless of the contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
# This makes an eslint/prettier run byte-deterministic across a Windows dev machine
# and the Linux CI runner — before this, the working tree was CRLF while the blobs
# were LF, so `eslint --fix` flipped line endings and "clean" meant different bytes
# in each place. Binary files are auto-detected by `text=auto` and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
